  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  Title: Snowballs
  TextTuto: "The game being a snow fight, you are able to grab and drop snow. You
    can check on the number of snowballs you currently carry with the number at the
    bottom left corner of the screen. \n\n[LMB] - Throw Snowball\n[RMB] - Reload
    Snowball\n\nTo reload, look at the ground to grab the snow ! Also, watch out
    : the snowballs are affected by gravity !"
  PanelTuto: {fileID: 272400631}
